################
Data Workbench - Service Account S3 Bucket Registration

Registers and configures an Amazon S3 bucket for a Data Workbench service account, including the required permissions and access policies.

GitHub Create New Repo

Creates a new GitHub repository with the standard project structure, default settings, and required branch protections.

IMAC Lambda Layer Builder Module

Builds, packages, and publishes AWS Lambda layers so they can be shared across multiple Lambda functions.

IMAC Security Hub Scanning Module

Runs AWS Security Hub scans to identify security findings, compliance issues, and misconfigurations across AWS resources.

Jenkins Agent Node Instance Refresh

Refreshes Jenkins agent EC2 instances by replacing existing nodes with new ones to apply updates, patches, and configuration changes.

Jenkins-Agent-SIE-API-IP-Update

Updates the SIE API IP address configuration on Jenkins agents to maintain connectivity with external services.

GitHub Repository

Performs administrative GitHub repository tasks such as updating repository settings, managing permissions, and maintaining repository configuration.

Seed Job

Creates and updates Jenkins folders, pipelines, and jobs from source-controlled configuration files to keep the Jenkins environment consistent.

Self Serve Infra Teardown

Safely decommissions infrastructure by destroying selected AWS resources and cleaning up associated configurations.

SIA OSS Package Scan

Scans open-source software dependencies for known vulnerabilities, licensing issues, and outdated packages before deployment.
